  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3915,
      "text": "But they rejected him, so they will surely be brought [for punishment],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 127,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3916,
      "text": "except the chosen slaves of Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 128,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3917,
      "text": "And We left for him [a favorable mention] among later generations:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 129,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3918,
      "text": "“Peace be upon Elias.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 130,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3919,
      "text": "This is how We reward those who do good.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 131,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3920,
      "text": "He was one of Our believing slaves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 132,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3921,
      "text": "Lot was indeed one of the messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 133,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3922,
      "text": "When We saved him and all of his household,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 134,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3923,
      "text": "except an old woman[29] who was among those who stayed behind.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 135,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3924,
      "text": "Then We destroyed the rest.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 136,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3925,
      "text": "You [Makkans] pass by their ruins by day",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 137,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3926,
      "text": "and by night. Do you still not understand?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 138,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 389,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3927,
      "text": "Jonah was indeed one of the messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 139,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3928,
      "text": "When he fled to the fully laden ship,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 140,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3929,
      "text": "then he cast lots[30] with them, but was among those who lost.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 141,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3930,
      "text": "The whale then swallowed him while he was blameworthy[31].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 142,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3931,
      "text": "Were it not for the fact that he was one of those who glorify Allah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 143,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3932,
      "text": "he would have stayed in its belly until the Day of Resurrection[32].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 144,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3933,
      "text": "But We cast him ashore on a barren land while he was ill,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 145,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3934,
      "text": "and caused a gourd vine[33] to grow over him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 146,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3935,
      "text": "We sent him[34] to one hundred thousand people or more,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 147,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3936,
      "text": "and they believed, so We let them enjoy for a while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 148,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3937,
      "text": "So ask them, “Does your Lord have daughters while they have sons?”[35]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 149,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3938,
      "text": "Or did We create the angels as females while they were watching?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 150,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3939,
      "text": "No indeed, it is one of their fabrications when they say,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 151,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3940,
      "text": "“Allah has children,” and they are truly liars.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 152,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 451,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3941,
      "text": "Did He choose daughters over sons[36]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
